# Nexa — Landing Page

## OIBSIP Web Development Internship

This project was created for Task 1 of the Oasis Infobyte Web Development internship.

## Project Overview

Nexa is a fictional productivity platform designed to help users organize their work, manage tasks, and improve productivity.

The project demonstrates foundational HTML5 and CSS3 skills through a responsive, modern landing page.

## Technologies Used

- HTML5
- CSS3
- Google Fonts
- CSS Flexbox
- CSS Grid

## Features

- Sticky navigation bar
- Responsive navigation
- Hero section
- Call-to-action buttons
- Productivity dashboard visual
- Features section
- About section
- Progress indicators
- Testimonial section
- Call-to-action section
- Footer with social/contact links
- Responsive mobile layout
- Consistent color palette
- Responsive CSS Grid and Flexbox layouts

